Subject: Extension of the JS Model as a multistate model with multiple states
Message-ID: <KEzhalDSsTY.6tn4TuWIm6YJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/hmecology/c/KEzhalDSsTY/m/6tn4TuWIm6YJ>
